      "arabic": "١٠٩٢٠- البرصاء:\nوالدة شبيب بن البرصاء، هي التي خطبها النبيّ ﷺ من أبيها، فقال: إن بها بياضا ولم يكن بها، فرجع فوجدها برصت. اسمها أمامة. وقيل قرصافة.",
      "english": "10920 — al-Barsa':\n\nThe mother of Shabib ibn al-Barsa'. She is the woman whose hand the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, asked of her father in marriage. Her father said, “She has a white discoloration,” though she had none. He then returned and found that she had developed leprosy. Her name was Umama. It is also said: Qursafa.",
